{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119552","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119552/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119552/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119552/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119552","id":4471299308,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCoKc7A","number":119552,"title":"`ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD` in `ShaderMaterial` is equal to `1.0` when conditionally skipped.","user":{"login":"dhoverb","id":226178021,"node_id":"U_kgDODXsz5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226178021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb","html_url":"https://github.com/dhoverb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-05-18T17:48:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T09:08:41Z","closed_at":"2026-05-20T01:54:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe [description for ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.html) says:\n```\nIf written to, values below a certain amount of alpha are discarded.\n```\nHowever `ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD = 1.0` is applied when a shader conditionally does not write to it, instead of blending alpha.\n\nFor example:\n`Enable Alpha Scissor` is false, but the texture is incorrectly transparent when `Alpha` is `0.99`\n<img width=\"1715\" height=\"991\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dd4b357-20b4-4b3c-b619-34cd450aa31a\" />\n\nand is opaque when `Alpha` is `1.0`\n<img width=\"1715\" height=\"991\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/617f0ce2-ae56-441a-b609-d5a411a8495b\" />\n\nNotice that this behavior is consistent to when `ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD = 1.0` is set in the gdshader\n<img width=\"1715\" height=\"991\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/015fbfa4-6d54-40c6-abcb-0950a2773da3\" />\n<img width=\"1715\" height=\"991\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de527f65-9e4a-4fe0-99e6-6b558d08f68b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Unzip the MRP and open the project with the Godot editor.\n2. Double click on `new_shader_material.tres`\n3. In the inspector under `Shader Parameters`, adjust `Alpha` and notice that the texture is correctly transparent from `0.0` through `0.19` and correctly opaque from `0.2` through `1.0`.\n4. In the inspector under `Shader Parameters`, uncheck `Enable Alpha Scissor`.  Adjust `Alpha` and notice that the texture is incorrectly transparent from `0.0` through `0.99`, and opaque when `1.0`.\n5. Open `new_shader.gdshader` and turn this\n```\n  if (enable_alpha_scissor) {\n    ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD = 0.2;\n  }\n```\ninto\n```\n  //if (enable_alpha_scissor) {\n    ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD = 1.0;\n  //}\n```\n6. Double click on `new_shader_material.tres`\n7. Repeat step 4 and notice identical behavior as seen earlier in step 3, except this time it is correct since we set `ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD = 1.0`\n8. This was seen in with Forward+, Mobile, and Compatibility renderers.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[alpha-scissor-shader.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27969866/alpha-scissor-shader.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"mhilbrunner","id":1654763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQ3NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1654763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner","html_url":"https://github.com/mhilbrunner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119552/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}